---
title: Installation
description: How to set up the project locally.
order: 1
---

## Prerequisites

- [Bun](https://bun.sh) 1.4+
- Node.js 22+

## Setup

```bash
bun install
bun run dev
```

The project uses [shadcn-svelte](https://www.shadcn-svelte.com) for its UI primitives. New primitives can be added with:

```bash
bun x shadcn-svelte@latest add <component>
```

## Verifying your setup

```bash
bun run check
bun run build
```

See [CLI](/docs/cli) for how to install items from this registry into another project.
